paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092730/extras/7a378a6b3a88feffbd6681fdf0a8ed77.poster.avif?t=1780075192\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092730/extras/7a378a6b3a88feffbd6681fdf0a8ed77.webm?t=1780075192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092730/extras/7a378a6b3a88feffbd6681fdf0a8ed77.mp4?t=1780075192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092730/extras/31daaaf76e67f370790c2d33f761559f.webp?t=1780075192\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash high‑powered magic to throw, slam, impale, and shock every intruder in your castle. Each Elemental brings its own spells and unique super attacks that can eviscerate enemies or send them flying through the air. Use everything at your disposal to protect Aurora, the sleeping sorceress, and the castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092730/extras/f1ffb59989e7dd27d21d538305258a01.webp?t=1780075192\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seven Elementals</strong> – each with a unique weapon with combos, magic, and ultra‑attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flashy hack‑and‑slash combat, </strong>paired with cinematic super attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutscenes </strong>that follow Ever’s journey, unveiling Aurora’s fate and the castle’s future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience</strong> lets you level up both Ever's abilities and her Elementals' powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>35+ levels</strong> to battle through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller, keyboard, and mouse support</strong> with customizable/remappable buttons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post‑game challenges</strong> for the toughest players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castle expansion</strong> unlocks new zones as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam achievements</strong> offering extra challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092730/extras/f73e3f3a236f473f8f92c85e77750690.avif?t=1780075192\" width=892 height=250 /></span></p>", "short_description": "In a mysterious castle, sorceress Aurora has been asleep for centuries. Able to summon powerful Elementals to fight by her side, Ever must protect the fortress from monsters and its most‑sought‑after secret while trying to discover who was responsible for Aurora’s slumber and find a way to wake her.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092730/5d0e86b1d5f1a6b498ed196fc1b0108b149aad60/header.jpg?t=1780075192", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092730/03bce6374eaf8a756dcdf2081d2df5e0d069e190/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780075192", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092730/03bce6374eaf8a756dcdf2081d2df5e0d069e190/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780075192", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</stron